  "id": "aai",
  "term": "AAI",
  "definition": "AAI stands for animal-assisted intervention, an intervention that includes an animal or interaction with an animal as part of the activity. In research on AAIs, effects may reflect both animal-specific influences and broader contextual factors such as therapeutic contact, social interaction, or novelty.",
